						"name": "I thought this was supposed to be a cabin.",
						"ref": "Needle Gallery 3/I thought this was supposed to be a cabin./Gallery 3"
					},
					{
						"name": "If the Princess lives here, slaying her would probably be doing her a favor.",
						"ref": "Needle Gallery 4/If the Princess lives here, slaying her would probably be doing her a favor./Gallery 4"
					},
					{
						"name": "The only mistake you made last time was not pushing yourself hard enough.",
